    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86">

                <pb facs="0261" n="891" xml:id="pg891"/>

                <head>No. 392.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Received Feb. 16—5.5 p.m.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-02-16"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 16,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have communicated your telegrams of 12th and 14th to this government, and am
                    requested by President Figueras to convey to you the
                    expressions of satisfaction and appreciation with which our friendly assurances
                    have been received. My speech and that of the President in reply were afterward
                    read to the assembly by Castelar, and received with general
                    applause.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SICKLES.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
